  "description": "Enterprise-grade structured logging library for .NET with PII masking, attribute-based redaction, typed audit logging, file rotation, async buffering, BackgroundService lifecycle, test helpers, and Azure Application Insights integration. Fully compatible with Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.",
